  "description": "Newman contract tests for agenda-ai-paper-summaries task 1 (REQ-APS-001): the PaperSummary schema's read rule and lifecycle through OpenRegister's object API. A clerk (admin) and a member of decidesk-members read the same collection and get different counts: the member sees only shown summaries. A draft summary cannot be saved back to requested. Self-contained: seeds a probe member, an agenda item and two summaries, and tears them down.\n\n@spec openspec/changes/agenda-ai-paper-summaries/tasks.md#task-1",
